```
news_regime/
├── analysis/          # Sentiment, risk, impact, aggregation
├── api/              # (Not implemented - future API endpoints)
├── archive/          # Data retention & export
├── cli/              # Hourly job & daily archive CLI
├── common/           # Exceptions, logging, time utilities
├── config/           # Configuration models & loader
├── crawler/          # HTTP client & Naver crawler
├── domain/           # Core data models (all defined)
├── llm/              # LLM client & prompts (fully implemented)
├── mapping/          # Symbol dictionary & matcher
├── parser/           # HTML parsers
├── preprocess/       # Text normalization
├── recommend/        # Recommendation policy & engine
├── regime/           # Market regime classifier
├── storage/          # In-memory DB & repositories
└── tests/            # Comprehensive test suite (16 tests)
```

