## 🔄 Complete Pipeline Flow

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[Crawl Naver Finance] --> B[Parse Article List]
    B --> C[Fetch Full Articles]
    C --> D[Match to Symbols]
    D --> E[Analyze Sentiment/Risk/Impact]
    E --> F[Aggregate by Symbol]
    F --> G[Generate Recommendations]
    E --> H[Aggregate Globally]
    H --> I[Classify Regime]
    G --> J[Store Results]
    I --> J
```

